    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a0a8f57e-5db9-54dd-a618-df37258a66d8" activityNameId="8d1c4a9b-a7d0-53f4-ac6e-513ee186a41c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, aircraft, freight, intercontinental</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, aircraft, freight, intercontinental
Average fuel consumption and emission data caused by an intercontinal flight. The place of departure is Switzerland. The emissions are given for three subcategories: low poulated are, startosphere and unspecified.;
UUID: 830d1927-289e-3bc7-b41a-dd47e6906c7c
The invetory includes consumption of kerosene and direct emissions to air (gaseous emissions, particulate emissions, emissions of heavy metals)
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The data is calculated for today"s average aircraft technology
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics, publications of environmental agencies, information from aviation companies 
Extrapolations: Swiss data is extrapolated to represent European conditions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_830d1927-289e-3bc7-b41a-dd47e6906c7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
